{title: Vive le vent (Jingle Bells)}
{artist: James Lord Pierpont}
{key: C}
{comment: Paroles anglaises (domaine public) ; les paroles françaises de « Vive le vent » ne le sont pas}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Jingle bells, jingle bells,
Jingle all the [C]way!
[F]Oh, what fun it [C]is to ride
In a [D7]one-horse open [G7]sleigh, hey!
[C]Jingle bells, jingle bells,
Jingle all the [C]way!
[F]Oh, what fun it [C]is to ride
In a [G7]one-horse open [C]sleigh!
{end_of_chorus}
